      statusNote: 'The four lines were voted on 4 June 2026. Cleaning passed with the minimum 21 votes — the Frente Amplio\'s 17 plus four opposition councillors who voted with the governing bloc: independent Guillermo Kruse, Colorado Federico Paganini and National Party members Nicolás Hernández and Joaquín Campos — and sanitation was approved unanimously, with 31 votes according to Subrayado. An oversight commission with majority opposition participation was also created. As of this file\'s closing (August 2026) no subsequently awarded tenders have been verified for this file.',
